["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"118. 对李想的第二次3小时访谈：CEO大模型、MoE、梁文锋、VLA、能量、记忆、对抗人性、亲密关系、人类的智慧 VLA MoE AgentOS RLHF 世界模型\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-10-30-zhangxiaojun-李想-通用-agent-五年内不会出现-只会先有-agentos/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a2c96d240eb08aa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:46:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>李想：通用 agent 五年内不会出现，只会先有 agentOS</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">李想判断通用 agent 五年内不会出现，真正会出现的是 agentOS——各专业在上面开发自己的专业 agent。因为生产工具必须能行动、能替代专业工作，而不是给个建议。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自动驾驶</span><span class=\"tag\">VLA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"117. 开源一段论文探索之旅：模型范式、Infra和数据、语言、多模态的完整变迁史 MFU MOE COT LoRA RLHF 光流\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-10-28-zhangxiaojun-模型是炼油厂-第一阶段的赢家不是最后的赢家/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a079c1aa86947eb7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">4:22:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>模型是炼油厂：第一阶段的赢家不是最后的赢家</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">商业史上第一波跑出来的公司几乎从不是下个阶段的赢家。模型公司是提炼基础油的炼油厂，值钱的是化工厂和汽车公司。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">论文精读</span><span class=\"tag\">模型范式</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"116. 吴明辉口述19年史：漫长的沉浮、痛苦急转、企业级Agentic Model、现实世界的数值游戏、IPO agentic model pass@1 MOA context\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-10-09-zhangxiaojun-模型是炼油厂-值钱的是化工厂和汽车公司/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bb4fc975caeda4bd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">3:47:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1009</span></div>\n<h2>模型是炼油厂，值钱的是化工厂和汽车公司</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">基础模型只要有两家以上就不可能赚钱，会像电价一样被卷成电费；真正的壁垒是别人没存下来的 context 数据，以及大厂因为晋升机制永远做不了的最后一公里。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企业级AI</span><span class=\"tag\">数据壁垒</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"115. 对OpenAI姚顺雨3小时访谈：6年Agent研究、人与系统、吞噬的边界、既单极又多元的世界 pass@k pass^k affordance memory hierarchy intrinsic reward\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-09-11-zhangxiaojun-ai-下半场-通用方法已经有了-难的是找任务/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfbf7de74c2135f3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:31:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>AI 下半场：通用方法已经有了，难的是找任务</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">姚顺雨说 AI 主线已从「造武器」进入「选战场」——方法终于通用了，但真正的瓶颈不是推理能力，而是模型拿不到人脑子里的 context。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">强化学习</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"114. 与殷一、欧迪聊聊萨洛蒙：中国意外的增长阀门、小众越野跑与少女故事 the winning moments OOTD repeat traffic\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-09-06-zhangxiaojun-越野跑核心人群十年没变-萨洛蒙靠女性破了圈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2776969c0511e305-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0906</span></div>\n<h2>越野跑核心人群十年没变，萨洛蒙靠女性破了圈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中国越野跑核心人群十年前十万人，今年还是十万人，区别是老了十岁。萨洛蒙没丢专业线，靠女性拉新把会员从十万做到八百万。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消费品牌</span><span class=\"tag\">户外运动</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"113. 和杨植麟时隔1年的对话：K2、Agentic LLM、缸中之脑和“站在无限的开端” Muon optimizer test time scaling brain in a vat reward hacking curriculum learning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-08-27-zhangxiaojun-管公司像训模型-sft-太多-团队就没有创造力了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b659eec041fc4bbc-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:41:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>管公司像训模型：SFT 太多，团队就没有创造力了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Tim 天天跟杨植麟讲：管理要用 RL 的方式，不是 SFT。SFT 是直接告诉人该怎么做，太多，人就没有主观能动性；RL 只给奖励，但奖励定义不好，全队都会去 hack 它。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">Agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"112. 和广密聊大模型季报：分化与收敛、全家桶与垂直整合、L4体验与挖矿窗口 Reward Hacking L4 体验 全家桶 垂直整合 DPI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-08-18-zhangxiaojun-模型公司是挖矿的-产品公司是炼矿的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dba5cdc7209fbd97-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0818</span></div>\n<h2>模型公司是挖矿的，产品公司是炼矿的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">最好的模型拿走了最大的流量和收入，但挖矿的窗口正在缩短：从两年到九个月再到三四个月。基础模型公司开始端到端做 Agent，应用公司的成本劣势是结构性的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 投资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"111. 李一帆口述激光雷达11年创业史：你仔细想行业的机会来自哪？是国家、民族的机会 ASIC ITC POC Robotaxi Tier 1\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-08-07-zhangxiaojun-激光雷达降价-99-5-靠的不是上量而是设计/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2a07079c1963cee2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">3:08:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0807</span></div>\n<h2>激光雷达降价 99.5%，靠的不是上量而是设计</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">硬件的降本不来自规模，来自设计能力：把几十万一台的激光雷达做进芯片，才可能从功能件变成安全件，最后变成标配。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">激光雷达</span><span class=\"tag\">硬科技创业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"110. 逐段讲解Kimi K2报告并对照ChatGPT Agent、Qwen3-Coder等：“系统工程的力量” MCP KV Cache verifiable reward reward hacking persona partial rollout\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-07-30-zhangxiaojun-kimi-k2-把配方全公开了-但复现它仍是手艺活/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4f4a70954860f9ed-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:20:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0730</span></div>\n<h2>Kimi K2 把配方全公开了，但复现它仍是手艺活</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Kimi K2 报告把数据合成、可验证奖励、RL 基础设施的 recipe 全写出来了，但每个 prompt、每个参数都要调稳，本质是系统工程而非 idea。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">Kimi K2</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"109. 机器人遭遇数据荒？与谢晨聊：仿真与合成数据、Meta天价收购和Alexandr Wang Sim2Real Real2Sim data pyramid cross embodiment acquihire scaling law moment\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-07-15-zhangxiaojun-仿真不等于仿真器-机器人数据荒里最赚钱的是原料商/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/17864fa8278d8825-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:41:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0715</span></div>\n<h2>仿真不等于仿真器：机器人数据荒里最赚钱的是原料商</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">具身智能还在 GPT-1 阶段，没找到 scaling law 的配方。真正卡住行业的是高质量物理资产和场景，而不是仿真器——所以做仿真器的人反而最不赚钱。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">合成数据</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"108. 余凯口述30年史：世界不止刀光剑影，是一部人来人往的江湖故事 PMF Cuda Baseband HMI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-07-07-zhangxiaojun-科学家创业最大的-bug-不知道客户是谁/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9b30b49056fd22ca-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:57:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0707</span></div>\n<h2>科学家创业最大的 bug：不知道客户是谁</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">地平线前五年在空调、玩具、家电、汽车之间 360 度扫射，2019 年砍掉一半人、欧印汽车，才从乱打乱撞变成战略驱动的公司。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">创业</span><span class=\"tag\">芯片</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"107. 和梦秋的catch-up：创投挺无聊，也聊聊旅行读书和女性主义 sim2real general purpose agent reductive\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-06-29-zhangxiaojun-ai-应用没找到场景-deepseek-也没繁荣创业生态/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8c74c419a6b9140d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:30:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0629</span></div>\n<h2>AI 应用没找到场景，DeepSeek 也没繁荣创业生态</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">清流资本王梦秋的判断：资本寒冬没过去，DeepSeek 抹平了信息差却没造出新场景，通用 Agent 可能是伪命题，真正刚需的是垂直工作流。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>15</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 应用</span><span class=\"tag\">Agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"106. 和王鹤聊，具身智能的学术边缘史和资本轰炸后的人为乱象 sim2real VLA perception action loop object goal navigation six dof pose\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-06-22-zhangxiaojun-机器人公司最大的敌人不是技术-是摇操和讲故事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6d36c7ae97ae40ab-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:38:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0622</span></div>\n<h2>机器人公司最大的敌人不是技术，是摇操和讲故事</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">王鹤说这一代具身智能公司只有两条死路：长期漂着讲故事，或者每个场景从头重做。他押注合成数据，真实数据只占训练量的1%。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">人形机器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"105. 和奔驰王忻聊，产业大转折下的德国汽车、话语权和技术battle Tier 1 QNX Rule-based 端到端 SOA V2X\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-06-19-zhangxiaojun-奔驰中国团队用数据跟德国总部抢话语权/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/41a98711cc822d74-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:32:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0619</span></div>\n<h2>奔驰中国团队用数据跟德国总部抢话语权</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Tier 1 黑盒交付的时代结束了，主机厂要自己 operate 数据。中国团队不是把话语权夺过来的，是承诺、交付、建立信任换来的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽车</span><span class=\"tag\">智能驾驶</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"104. 和Rokid祝铭明聊，吴妈、阿里、硬件创业黑森林的第11年 Always on System Cost PMF 敢为人后\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-06-15-zhangxiaojun-ai-会取代手机-但赢家可能不是手机厂商/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3cce440d4536846b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:08:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0615</span></div>\n<h2>AI 会取代手机，但赢家可能不是手机厂商</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">祝铭明说 AI 一定会取代手机，但眼镜不是赢者通吃的生意，最多十家分桌吃饭；他赌的是大厂看不见、看不懂、看不上、来不及的那两三年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">智能眼镜</span><span class=\"tag\">硬件创业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"103. Lovart创始人陈冕复盘应用创业这两年：这一刻就是好爽啊！！哈哈哈哈哈 PMF agentic workflow break even\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-06-08-zhangxiaojun-ai-应用创业-通用-agent-吃不掉垂类-第一年差点死掉/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/63ceb3c5d2d844aa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:45:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0608</span></div>\n<h2>AI 应用创业：通用 Agent 吃不掉垂类，第一年差点死掉</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">陈冕复盘：第一代产品赢了补贴战却被下架，账上只剩 4000 块；垂类 Agent 的机会在于通用模型吃不下行业数据和交互，前提是 AGI 五年内不来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 应用</span><span class=\"tag\">垂类 Agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"102. 和张祥雨聊，多模态研究的挣扎史和未来两年的2个“GPT-4时刻” next token prediction critical decision Meta-CoT feature collapse environment scaling Linear Transformer\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-06-02-zhangxiaojun-多模态缺的不是架构-是视觉空间里的思维链/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/653276f39f011f45-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:28:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0602</span></div>\n<h2>多模态缺的不是架构，是视觉空间里的思维链</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">图像的理解、生成、人类对齐三者天然割裂，因为图像来自大自然、不包含人类对它的理解；生成模型至今还停在语言模型「一口爆」的原始形态，连 CoT 都没有。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">多模态</span><span class=\"tag\">思维链</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"101. 对YouWare创始人明超平3小时访谈：今天Agent像大猩猩刚拿起一根烧火棍 per token valuation web coder agent rank the bitter lesson\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-05-28-zhangxiaojun-agent-像大猩猩刚拿起烧火棍-token-消耗速度才是关键指标/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7a30891133f762c8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:42:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0528</span></div>\n<h2>Agent 像大猩猩刚拿起烧火棍，token 消耗速度才是关键指标</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">明超平把 AI 产品的关键指标从 DAU 换成 token 消耗速度，又进一步改成 per token valuation——因为 token 消耗大不代表价值高，就像石油转化为机械能的效率才是关键。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">产品方法论</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"100. 对话奔驰全球CEO康林松：转型期CEO和转型之中的139岁奔驰 MBOS L3 CLTC ECU\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-05-23-zhangxiaojun-奔驰ceo-2030年若市场不纯电-我们两种车都造/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ae02e39916eeef4f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">57:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0523</span></div>\n<h2>奔驰CEO：2030年若市场不纯电，我们两种车都造</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">康林松不赌单一技术路线：坚持2030年前推出完整电动车序列，同时保留燃油和电动两种选择。他判断中国是节奏最快、竞争压力最大的市场，能在中国赢，在全球赢的概率就更高。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽车</span><span class=\"tag\">电动化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"99. 对能量奇点创始人杨钊3小时访谈：人类驯服可控核聚变还有多少路程？ Q值 三乘积 托卡马克 高温超导 FRC\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-04-28-zhangxiaojun-聚变真正的原料不是氘氚-是氘氘/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9e4068698af4899d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:34:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0428</span></div>\n<h2>聚变真正的原料不是氘氚，是氘氘</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">氘氚路线要边发电边造氚，监管和成本都高；氘氘不涉氚，才是规模化商业电站的前提，但三乘积要从21次方再上一个数量级。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">可控核聚变</span><span class=\"tag\">高温超导</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"98. 逐篇讲解机器人基座模型和VLA经典论文——“人就是最智能的VLA” VLA Action Chunking Transformer Model Predictive Control Co-Fine Tuning Diffusion Policy Unified Action Space\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-04-06-zhangxiaojun-机器人不需要等到-aha-moment-才落地/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ebe187bae6eda636-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:29:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0406</span></div>\n<h2>机器人不需要等到 aha moment 才落地</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">机器人领域还没出现大模型那种 aha moment，但能力提升的斜率已经起来了，每一年每一个月的能力增长都会沿途解锁新的商业机会，不用等通用智能成熟再找应用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">机器人</span><span class=\"tag\">VLA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"97. 25年Q1大模型季报：和广密聊当下最大非共识、AGI的主线与主峰 Pretraining Post Training RL Tool Use Long Context Online Learning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-03-30-zhangxiaojun-预训练才是主峰-智能本身就是最大的应用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c27ae452558c5f81-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:01:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0330</span></div>\n<h2>预训练才是主峰：智能本身就是最大的应用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型公司是炼油厂，值钱的是化工厂和汽车公司；但今天最大的红利是承接研究溢出的智能，而不是做产品拉动的应用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">预训练</span><span class=\"tag\">Agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"96. 和郎咸朋聊，自动驾驶10年演进史、关键技术细节和特斯拉 BEV Transformer VLM MPI VLA 3DGS\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-03-16-zhangxiaojun-l3-不是-l2-的延长-而是-l4-的先导/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/46bac62b6c4b8b63-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:00:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0316</span></div>\n<h2>L3 不是 L2 的延长，而是 L4 的先导</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">理想自动驾驶团队用端到端把 200 万行代码砍到 20 万行，纵向控制第一次超过所有竞品——不是人更聪明，是终于用做能力而不是做功能的方式做自动驾驶。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自动驾驶</span><span class=\"tag\">端到端</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"95. 对Manus创始人肖弘的3小时访谈：世界不是线性外推，做博弈中的重要变量 Andy-Bill 定律 Agentic Yolo 模式 PMF GAIA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-03-02-zhangxiaojun-世界不是线性外推-做博弈里那个重要变量/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/766e33c00e9ce2db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">3:22:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0302</span></div>\n<h2>世界不是线性外推：做博弈里那个重要变量</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">如果世界是逻辑推导，今天最大的推荐引擎公司是百度。肖弘说创业者要做的不是推演必然，而是让自己成为改变博弈结果的那个变量。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 应用</span><span class=\"tag\">Agent</span>\n</div></div></a>"]